//! The sample alignments, the trees built from them, and the contig-assembly samples.
//!
//! Every alignment member is a public NCBI record, identified by an exact match (US-01M6TGKH):
//! scripts/outside-data/identify_alignment_members.py found, for each member, the record its
//! ungapped sequence equals, or the region of a record it equals, and records the result. A
//! member's `accession` is that record's accession.version. A member that is a region of the
//! record carries one `extracted region` feature named for the record, whose note gives the
//! region's 1-based, inclusive coordinates in the record (`start -> end`) and whose strand is the
//! record strand. src/__tests__/sampleAlignmentProvenance.test.ts checks every member against the
//! record scripts/outside-data/fetch.sh fetches.
//!
//! Dropped and replaced members, per set:
//! - doc-aln-coxii-cds: none dropped
//! - doc-aln-hiv-env: none dropped
//! - doc-aln-ig-variable: none dropped
//! - doc-aln-lysr-family: none dropped
//! - doc-aln-pairwise-protein: replaced pwprot-seq-1 (Kiwifruit (2ACT)) by 2ACT_A, chain A of the PDB entry it names, which records the active-site Cys25 as unknown (X); none dropped
//! - doc-aln-three-kingdoms: none dropped
//! - doc-aln-transcript-variants: none dropped
//! - doc-aln-people: dropped, the fictitious-character set (people-seq-1 to people-seq-5), with its tree
//!
//! Every sample here is MolBioCraft's own computation on public records (US-01M6TDSV):
//! - The aligned samples' rows are MolBioCraft's MSA of the members' records, with the preset and
//!   residue cap their metadata names; no other aligner's output is stored. The unaligned samples
//!   hold the records, ungapped.
//! - The trees are MolBioCraft's Neighbor-Joining trees of the rebuilt alignments, built when the
//!   library is.
//! - The COI reads and the yghJ read sets are seeded simulations of their NCBI references, labelled
//!   as simulated; the COI contig is MolBioCraft's Sanger contig assembly of the two COI reads.
//! - No document carries another program's document dates: no `Created` or `Modified` field, and
//!   `created_at` / `updated_at` are when MolBioCraft rebuilt them.

use molbiocraft_align::{assemble_sanger_contig_poa, PoaReadInput};
use molbiocraft_core::{
    reverse_complement_iupac, AlignmentMemberSequence, ChromatogramData, DocumentAlignmentMeta, HistoryTreeNode, MoleculeType,
    SequenceDocument, SequenceFeature, Topology,
};
use std::collections::HashMap;

fn make_meta(entries: &[(&str, serde_json::Value)]) -> HashMap<String, serde_json::Value> {
    entries
        .iter()
        .map(|(k, v)| ((*k).to_string(), v.clone()))
        .collect()
}

